73
00:10:07,207 --> 00:10:13,508
And then, of course, read the text, maybe twice, maybe more.

74
00:10:14,327 --> 00:10:19,968
And then you will give the main idea in the first sentence.

75
00:10:20,228 --> 00:10:24,168
I mean, what the text is about, okay?

76
00:10:24,208 --> 00:10:25,968
