00:12:12,347 --> 00:12:13,168
it says that the text is not really central to the text.

105
00:12:13,168 --> 00:12:26,168
It says that the text is not really central to the text.

106
00:12:11,028 --> 00:12:17,028
Don't feel that you must reproduce the author's exact progression of thoughts.

107
00:12:18,028 --> 00:12:26,028
You don't need to say everything, you don't need to paraphrase or summarize everything that the author says.

108
00:12:26,028 --> 00:12:32,028
You must decide which points or which sentences are important.

109
00:12:32,028 --> 00:12:42,028
And details, examples, irrelevant parts should be omitted, excluded.

110
00:12:42,028 --> 00:12:46,028
Okay, don't include unnecessary parts.

111
00:12:46,028 --> 00:12:52,028
Because a summary is one third of the original text.

112
00:12:52,028 --> 00:12:54,028
One third of the original text.

113
