So if it's 200 lines, it should be like 60, 70.

114
00:13:04,028 --> 00:13:05,028
Okay?

115
00:13:05,028 --> 00:13:06,028
Lines.

116
00:13:06,028 --> 00:13:07,028
Okay.

117
00:13:07,028 --> 00:13:13,028
In general, omits minor details and specific examples.

118
00:13:13,028 --> 00:13:15,028
This is what I told you.

119
00:13:15,028 --> 00:13:16,028
Yes.

120
