133
00:14:04,028 --> 00:14:16,028
In the summary, you are going to give a brief, a sense of the text, the book, the article, the

134
00:14:16,028 --> 00:14:19,028
whatever you are summarizing, okay?

135
00:14:19,028 --> 00:14:27,028
You need to give a short, a brief, a sense of what you have read, what the writer said, but

136
00:14:27,028 --> 00:14:30,028
