You have read a book, you liked it very much, and you are telling it to a friend.

151
00:15:53,028 --> 00:16:05,028
And your friend, who hasn't read the book, can have an idea what the book is about, who the characters are, what the main events are.

152
00:16:05,028 --> 00:16:07,028
The main events are.

153
00:16:07,316 --> 00:16:26,516
And maybe a conclusion or whatever you have read, but in your own words, without reading from the book. You just tell your friend in your own words what you remember. And summary should be like this, in your own words, okay?

