Or How the Civil War Began by historian John Jones describes this and that.

160
00:17:26,064 --> 00:17:30,864
The book, the article describes this and that.

161
00:17:30,864 --> 00:17:46,903
Or the writer John Jones, historian John Jones, in his article How the Civil War Began, in commas, explains this and that.

162
00:17:46,903 --> 00:17:48,703
Okay, these are some options.

163
00:17:49,423 --> 00:17:58,943
Please, you must include, write the name of the author and the title of the text.

164
00:17:58,943 --> 00:18:08,443
You are summarizing in your first sentence with the main idea, giving us the information what this text is about.

