When you write a summary, you can check and you can use this chart to check if you have done everything correctly.

209
00:22:23,587 --> 00:22:25,748
First sentence is important.

210
00:22:26,708 --> 00:22:35,208
Name of the author, title of the article, and the main idea must be in the first sentence, okay?

211
00:22:35,208 --> 00:22:38,347
What is the text about?

212
00:22:40,968 --> 00:22:44,567
Yeah, is the length of the summary one-third of the original text?

213
00:22:44,968 --> 00:22:48,188
Key points in the original text underlined?

214
00:22:49,468 --> 00:22:52,228
All the details and examples excluded?

215
00:22:53,708 --> 00:22:56,908
Were the synonyms of the original words used?

216
00:22:57,108 --> 00:22:59,688
Were the structures of the sentences changed?

217
