Were the forms of the words changed?

218
00:23:05,208 --> 00:23:15,168
Because these are actually all synonyms, changed structures, or word forms.

219
00:23:15,807 --> 00:23:21,087
These are the ways that we use to paraphrase sentences.

220
00:23:21,468 --> 00:23:28,067
And paraphrase means writing the same information in your own words.

221
00:23:28,708 --> 00:23:30,908
Changing the sentence completely.

222
00:23:31,288 --> 00:23:32,448
How can you do it?

223
