Maybe you can turn an active sentence into passive, and you use synonyms of some of the words.

224
00:23:43,208 --> 00:23:53,728
And you can use the noun form of the verb, or you can use different conjunctions, transition words.

225
00:23:53,728 --> 00:23:58,048
Instead of saying although, you can say even though, for example.

