00:23:58,408 --> 00:24:08,288
Or you can better, what you can better is using despite, or in spite of, and then a noun, or a gerund.

227
00:24:08,788 --> 00:24:12,388
Changing the structure of the sentence.

228
00:24:13,528 --> 00:24:13,688
Okay?

